{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54374","headline":"偈 · 处真","name":"偈","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"一片凝然光灿烂，拟意追寻卒难见。\n炳（一作「瞥」）然掷（一作「撞」）着豁人情，大事分明皆总（一作「揔成」）办。\n是（一作「实」）快活，无系绊，万两黄金终不换。\n任地千圣出头来，从（一作「揔」）是向渠影中现。\n（见《景德传灯录》卷二十。\n注「一作」者，爲《五灯会元》卷十三之异文）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"处真","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54374.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54374","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}